theme: a terminal theme, in the terminal's own colors

theme_name = "terminal" draws with the terminal's default foreground
and background (Color::Reset, so no background is painted) and its 16
ANSI colors, instead of fixed RGB values: ghr then matches the rest of
the terminal, and follows a change to its palette.

